This endpoint fetches product data from a slow upstream API. Under load, many concurrent requests for the same product ID all miss the cache and each call the upstream separately:

```js
async function getProduct(id) {
  const cached = cache.get(id);
  if (cached) return cached;
  const data = await fetchFromUpstream(id);
  cache.set(id, data);
  return data;
}
```

